  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 88 * 4 * 15 * 3 * 1 * 4\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) − ÷ = × + \n\n88 * 4 * 15 * 3 * 1 * 4 ⇒ 88 - 4 ÷ 15 = 3 × 1 + 4\n\n⇒ 88 - __**4 **____**÷**____** 15**__ = __**3 **____**×**____** 1**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**88 - 0.27**__ = __**3**____** + 4**__\n\n⇒ 87.73 ≠ 7 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) − = × + ÷\n\n88 * 4 * 15 * 3 * 1 * 4 ⇒ 88 - 4 = 15 × 3 + 1 ÷ 4\n\n⇒ __**88 - 4**__ = 15 × 3 + __**1 **____**÷ 4**__\n\n⇒ 84 = __**15 **____**×**____** 3**__ + 0.25\n\n⇒ 84 = __**45**____** + 0.25**__\n\n⇒ 84 ≠ 45.25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ÷ − = × +\n\n88 * 4 * 15 * 3 * 1 * 4 ⇒ 88 ÷ 4 - 15 = 3 × 1 + 4\n\n⇒ __**88 ÷ 4**__ - 15 = __**3 × 1**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**22 - 15**__ = __**3 + 4**__\n\n⇒ 7 = 7 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷ −× + =\n\n88 * 4 * 15 * 3 * 1 * 4 ⇒ 88 ÷ 4 - 15 × 3 + 1 = 4\n\n⇒ __**88 ÷ 4**__ - 15 × 3 + 1 = 4\n\n⇒ 22 - __**15 × 3**__ + 1 = 4\n\n⇒ __**22 + 1**__ - 45 = 4\n\n⇒ __23____** - 45**__ = 4\n\n⇒ -22 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
